                "$comment": "③ REFERENCE_VALUE_MATCH：定性项目，报告只印了结果与参考值。约束与 ② 对称，只是比较条件换成 valueMatch。",
                "if": {
                  "properties": {
                    "conclusionBasis": {
                      "const": "REFERENCE_VALUE_MATCH"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
